OL,3,GNEWSATeacher who drove to pupil's house
OL,4,Ain night banned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher who told a pupil she had "a
OL,7,Freal effect" on him before later
OL,8,Fentering into a sexual relationship
OL,9,Fwith her has been struck off.
OL,11,FMark Fletcher, 45, behaved
OL,12,F"inappropriately" towards a pupil at
OL,13,FRidgeway School and Sixth Form College
OL,14,Fin Swindon, Wiltshire, in 2019,
OL,15,Fincluding driving to her home in the
OL,16,Fthe night and emailing her outside
OL,17,Fschool hours, a Teaching Regulation
OL,18,FAgency (TRA) panel found.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
