OL,3,GNEWSATeacher who drove to pupil's house
OL,4,Ain night banned
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe relationship became sexual after
OL,7,Fthe pupil left the school. Fletcher was
OL,8,Fsuspended in July 2023 after she
OL,9,Fdisclosed the relationship. He disputed
OL,10,Fall allegations.
OL,12,FA TRA professional conduct panel found
OL,13,Fhis actions amounted to misconduct of a
OL,14,Fserious nature and ruled he should be
OL,15,Fbanned.
